# ── Project-specific ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The authority-response cache is deliberately NOT committed. It is a ~50 MB artefact that buys
# about 9 s off an already 38 s cold run (budget: 300 s), and its entries expire after 7 days by
# design — the brief says to re-verify at submission time, so a stale cached answer is a liability,
# not a speed-up. It is rebuilt on first run.
.gtcache/
cache/
legacy/
*.pptx
*.pdf
